SUMMARY:Triangle Native American Film Festival
LOCATION:The Rialto Theatre\, 1620 Glenwood Ave\, Raleigh\, NC 27608
DESCRIPTION:The Triangle Native American Film Festival — featuring powerf
 ul films from Lumbee storytellers and Indigenous creators representing Tri
 bal Nations across the U.S.\, including Sundance shorts. Includes filmmake
 r panels\, food trucks with local Native chefs\, and an interactive filmma
 king tutorial. Hosted by Triangle Native American Society. Show: 2:30 PM.
URL:https://therialto.com/event/triangle-native-american-film-festival/the-
 rialto-theatre/
UID:43d8772c852a8598@rialto-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260608T120000Z
END:VEVENT
